    description: "Found by the 2026-10-20 docstring-staleness audit (verifier reproduced). The module docstring says a class, struct or interface records its base list in `meta[\"base_classes\"]`. `_extract_base_list` is called only in the class (~L944) and interface (~L1002) branches; the struct_declaration branch (~L1041-1077) passes no meta. Repro: `namespace N { interface IBase {} struct S : IBase { public void Go() {} } }` -> `struct S` meta None. Fix: call `_extract_base_list` / `_csharp_base_hints` in the struct arm too. Related: WI-kajoh (records emit no symbol)."  # 2d9b
    fields: {}  # 2d9b
